{"id":"1265313460981772289","date":"2020-05-26","url":"https://x.com/EthanJPerez/status/1265313460981772289","author":"EthanJPerez","text":"New work! We present a single, retrieval-based architecture that can learn a variety of knowledge-intensive tasks: extractive and generative! Cool results (and SOTAs) on open-domain extractive QA, abstractive QA, fact verification, and question generation. W/ many at @facebookai","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/PSH_Lewis/status/1265300549777440775","text":"Thrilled to share new work! “Retrieval-Augmented Generation for Knowledge-Intensive NLP tasks”.\nBig gains on Open-Domain QA, with new State-of-the-Art results on NaturalQuestions, CuratedTrec and WebQuestions.\ncheck out here: https://t.co/SVZ6K4tDn5.\n1/N https://t.co/w4CwLxiWxr"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20200526193333","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200526193333/https://twitter.com/EthanJPerez/status/1265313460981772289","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
