{"id":"1245088253843210240","date":"2020-03-31","url":"https://x.com/EthanJPerez/status/1245088253843210240","author":"EthanJPerez","text":"Now with code from @facebookai, based on XLM and @huggingface transformers! https://t.co/cPnNdbhgRG\n\nAnd with blog post:  https://t.co/5eQpu9lbZq\n\nHave fun training your own models to decompose questions into easier sub-questions... fully unsupervised!","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/EthanJPerez/status/1232127027961942018","text":"New! \"Unsupervised Question Decomposition for Question Answering\": https://t.co/iGBdJnRERI\n\nWe decompose a hard Q into several, easier Qs with *unsupervised learning*, improving multi-hop QA on HotpotQA without extra supervision.\n\nw/@PSH_Lewis @scottyih @kchonyc @douwekiela (1/n) https://t.co/Z8ADXlLHoR"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20200331205204","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200331205204/https://twitter.com/EthanJPerez/status/1245088253843210240","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
