{"id":"1243717392611540993","date":"2020-03-28","url":"https://x.com/EthanJPerez/status/1243717392611540993","author":"EthanJPerez","text":"These clips are very entertaining (and informative)","quoted":{"url":"https://x.com/ARGleave/status/1243373829650395138","text":"Excited to share our work @iclr_conf: deep RL policies can be attacked by another agent taking actions that create natural adversarial observations. (1/5)\n\nBlog: https://t.co/hxwEQJGuTB\nPaper: https://t.co/tsk8o6s0rZ\nVideos: https://t.co/sDfDgg98z0\nCode: https://t.co/YeWtwjPlFk https://t.co/103sB0MXGe"},"live_status":200,"archived_at":"20200328020828","archive":"https://web.archive.org/web/20200328020828/https://twitter.com/EthanJPerez/status/1243717392611540993","via":"wayback","read_at":"2026-09-30"}
